WEBVTT

00:15:59.912 --> 00:16:04.746
And try not to say I am, as in I am angry
or I am sad when you say I am,

00:16:04.746 --> 00:16:06.746
it makes you sound as if
you are the emotion,

00:16:07.537 --> 00:16:10.037
whereas you are you and the
emotion is datasource.

00:16:10.954 --> 00:16:13.204
Instead, try to notice the
feeling for what it is.

00:16:13.204 --> 00:16:16.704
I'm noticing that I'm feeling sad or I'm
noticing that I'm feeling angry.

00:16:18.496 --> 00:16:22.329
These are essential skills for us,
our families, our communities,

00:16:22.871 --> 00:16:24.746
they are also critical to the workplace.

00:16:26.496 --> 00:16:29.246
In my research, when I looked at
what helps people to bring

00:16:29.246 --> 00:16:32.454
the best of themselves to work, I found
a powerful, key contributor,